    "sub_ename": "WATER AND SOIL CONSERVATION AND ENVIRONMENT MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程邀請水土保持技師公會所推薦的技師群，藉由實際的案??明和現地?觀，使本學程的學生?能瞭解生態工法、水土保持工程、水?工程、河川生態?育等之內涵，並藉由討??協助學生?瞭解現代化的水土環境經?需具備的基本條件。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is taught by practitioners of the Association of Soil and Water Conservation Professional Engineer. Course objective is to enhance students' ability in water and soil conservation and environment planning and management to integrate professional knowledge into practice.",
